<% content_for :partners_content do %>

  <%= render template: "site/partners/templates/hero", locals: {
    header: "Driving innovation through partnership",
    text: "Discover innovations our partners are delivering across GitHub products. From Copilot to runners, these collaborations are shaping the future of software development.",
    role: 'partnerships',
    button_text: "Apply to be a Technology Partner",
    button_link: "/partners/apply?partnershipType=Technology+Partner",
    additional_buttons: nil,
    showConfetti: "false"
  } %>


  <div class="position-relative overflow-hidden">

    <img alt="graphic of lines" src="<%= image_path '/static/images/modules/site/technology-partners/images/patterns/lines-left.svg' %>" class="position-absolute" style="top: -75px; left: 0; z-index: 0">
    <img alt="graphic of lines" src="<%= image_path '/static/images/modules/site/technology-partners/images/patterns/lines-right.svg' %>" class="position-absolute d-none d-sm-block" style="top: -70px; right: 0; z-index: 0">

    <div class="container-xl position-relative" style="z-index: 1">
    <div class="text-center mt-8 col-12 col-md-6 mx-auto">
    <h2 class="h0-mktg text-bold ">We are better together</h2>
</div>

<div class="text-left d-flex flex-wrap flex-md-nowrap flex-justify-center mt-7">
	<div class="col-12 col-md-4 m-6 text-center">
		<h2 class="h2-mktg text-bold mb-2 ">Role of technology partnerships</h2>
		<p class=" f4 px-4">Technology partnerships are essential for the GitHub ecosystem because they enable the integration of market-leading tools and services directly into GitHub's platform, enhancing the developer experience.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="col-12 col-md-4 m-6 text-center">
		<h2 class="h2-mktg text-bold mb-2 ">Benefits of partnering with GitHub</h2>
		<p class=" f4 px-4">The benefits of becoming a technology partner with GitHub extend beyond simple integration; they represent a strategic opportunity to be part of a thriving ecosystem that drives innovation and growth.</p>
	</div>

	<div class="col-12 col-md-4 m-6 text-center">
		<h2 class="h2-mktg text-bold mb-2 ">Access to GitHub events</h2>
		<p class=" f4 px-4">Technology partners gain early access to key GitHub events like <a href="https://githubuniverse.com/" target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' class="Link--inTextBlock">Universe</a> and <a href="https://galaxy.github.com/" target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' class="Link--inTextBlock">Galaxy</a>, providing them with opportunities to showcase their offering and collaborate closely with GitHub’s community.</p>
	</div>
</div>

      <div class="text-center mt-8 col-12 col-md-6 mx-auto">
        <h2 class="h0-mktg text-bold partners-title">Transforming development through strategic partnerships and innovations</h2>
      </div>

      <div class="container-xl">
        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap flex-md-nowrap mt-5 pt-8">

          <div class="col-md-6 col-12 text-center background-white color-shadow-large pb-7 px-3 px-md-6 mx-3 rounded-2">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-justify-between height-full">
              <h2 class="h0-mktg text-bold  mt-6 partners-title-box">Strategic partnerships with market leaders</h2>
              <p class="f3 mt-3 px-3">GitHub has teamed up with industry leaders like <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://github.com/marketplace/octopus-github-copilot-extension' class="text-bold text-underline">Octopus Deploy</a>, <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://github.com/marketplace/docker-for-github-copilot' class="text-bold text-underline">Docker</a>, <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://github.com/marketplace/launchdarkly-copilot-extension' class="text-bold text-underline">LaunchDarkly</a>, <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://github.com/marketplace/sentry-github-copilot-extension' class="text-bold text-underline">Sentry</a>, and <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://github.com/marketplace/teamsapp' class="text-bold text-underline">Microsoft Teams</a> to enhance our platform. These integrations create a robust AI developer ecosystem. Discover how GitHub Copilot is transforming coding in our <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=JclDSHrSZV0' class="text-bold text-underline">webinar</a>, and see the integrations in action with videos on <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pfiZIGGP29s' class="text-bold text-underline">Octopus Deploy</a> and <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=lZQ3biKpNr8' class="text-bold text-underline">Sentry</a>. Explore these extensions in the <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://github.com/marketplace?type=apps&copilot_app=true' class="text-bold text-underline">Copilot Marketplace</a>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>


          <div class="col-md-6 col-12 text-center background-white color-shadow-large pb-7 px-3 px-md-6 mx-3 rounded-2">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-justify-between height-full">
              <h2 class="h0-mktg text-bold  mt-6 partners-title-box">Expanding GitHub Marketplace</h2>
              <p class="f3 mt-3 px-3">The GitHub Marketplace offers a range of actions and apps that enhance the developer experience. Tools for automation and deployment seamlessly integrate with GitHub. Notably, <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=10J40Euwu7I' class="text-bold text-underline">Deployment Protection Rules</a> are now available. Find the latest innovations and tools in the <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://github.com/marketplace' class="text-bold text-underline">Marketplace</a>.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="d-flex flex-wrap flex-md-nowrap mt-12">

          <div class="col-md-6 col-12 text-center background-white color-shadow-large pb-7 px-3 px-md-6 mx-3 rounded-2">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-justify-between height-full">
              <h2 class="h0-mktg text-bold  mt-6 partners-title-box">Empowering Development with GitHub</h2>
              <p class="f3  mt-3 px-3">Technology partners are advancing development with GitHub Codespaces and Arm-based runners. Codespaces provides a cloud-based development environment, while <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=cgI6SBP8pEM' class="text-bold text-underline">Arm64 runners</a> offer cost savings and sustainability. Explore <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://github.blog/developer-skills/github/unleashing-github-codespaces-templates-to-ignite-your-development/' class="text-bold text-underline">Codespaces templates</a> and our overview video on Arm64 runners.</p>
            </div>
          </div>


          <div class="col-md-6 col-12 text-center background-white color-shadow-large pb-7 px-3 px-md-6 mx-3 rounded-2">
            <div class="d-flex flex-column flex-justify-between height-full">
              <h2 class="h0-mktg text-bold  mt-6 partners-title-box">Advancing Security in Software Development</h2>
              <p class="f3 mt-3 px-3">Security is a priority in software development. GitHub Advanced Security helps identify and fix vulnerabilities early. Learn about integrations with third-party tools in our <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://resources.github.com/security/integrating-github-advanced-security-with-third-party-platforms/' class="text-bold text-underline">white paper</a>, and join the <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://docs.github.com/code-security/secret-scanning/secret-scanning-partnership-program/secret-scanning-partner-program' class="text-bold text-underline">Secret Scanning program</a> to enhance security practices. Stay informed with <a target='_blank' rel='noopener noreferrer' href='https://github.blog/?s=secret+scanning+partner' class="text-bold text-underline">partner changelogs</a> for secure, resilient software.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>


    <div id="form-signUp" class="mt-9 mt-12">
      <div class="form-signUp-container position-relative mx-auto pb-12">

        <div class="footer-logo-section position-relative">
          <div class="d-flex flex-justify-around col-9 px-6 position-relative z-1">

          </div>
          <div class="col-3 position-absolute footer-logo-dots"></div>
        </div>

        <h2 class="h0-mktg text-center form-signUp-header text-bold pt-11">Become a GitHub&nbsp;Partner</h2>
        <p class="col-11 col-md-7 px-4 mx-auto f3-light mt-2 text-center form-signUp-subheader mb-7 ">Join GitHub's partner ecosystem to create powerful integrations and reach millions of developers. Gain access to resources, support, and a global network to help you innovate, grow, and succeed.</p>
        <div class="px-3 p-md-0">
          <div class="bg-transparent rounded-2  f4 form-signUp mx-auto text-center">
            <a href="/partners/apply?partnershipType=Technology+Partner" class="d-block btn-mktg width-full f4 mt-6" type="submit">Apply to be a Technology Partner</a>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
<% end %>

<%= render template: "site/partners/templates/layout_wrapper" %>
